  "prediction": "The meeting discussed the progress of a project on noise robustness and the evaluation of different features and neural networks for speech recognition. The team presented their results, including the use of PLP and MSG features, and the performance of the neural network with and without on-line normalization. They also discussed the integration of their work with the OGI team, who are working on a multi-band system, and the potential for combining their features and neural networks. The team decided to focus on improving the training set and targets, and to cut down on the number of experiments to be conducted. They also discussed the use of the Linux machine \"Swede\" for running neural net tools and the availability of CPU and disk space for training and computing. The meeting concluded with a discussion of the next steps and the need to address the issues of training set and targets.",
